            {
              "text": "(Question and answer style filming) The benefits of social media, like social connection, can decrease anxiety"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "tags": [],
      "uuid": "d5847ed3-359a-4058-a364-524ea529aa8c"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 183,
      "end_time": 221,
      "annotation": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "Loneliness can be combatted with social media - however, those connections are not always authentic/meaningful"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "tags": [],
      "uuid": "cb75b858-5f4d-472f-9f21-f72e53f2529b"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 226,
      "end_time": 250,
      "annotation": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "Social media can be addictive as it releases dopamine - comparison to effects of drugs and alcohol"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "tags": [],
      "uuid": "0d4c245d-b9f4-4701-8e41-02ce22aa40f9"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 251,
      "end_time": 260,
      "annotation": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "Algorithim intentionally keeps you engaged by feeding you content based on your interactions"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "tags": [],
      "uuid": "b2a86124-f630-4844-b1fa-da505f2c53a5"
    },
